NewMauville_Inside_Text_SteppedOnSwitchGeneratorStopped::
    .string "The floor plate sank under\n"
    .string "{PLAYER}'s weight.\p"
    .string "Somewhere behind the wall the\n"
    .string "generator wound down, and the\l"
    .string "lights came up a shade.$"

NewMauville_Inside_Text_GeneratorRadiatingHeat::
    .string "The generator is running hot\n"
    .string "enough to feel from here.\p"
    .string "Whatever WATTSON built this for,\n"
    .string "it has been doing it alone for a\l"
    .string "long time.$"

NewMauville_Inside_Text_GeneratorQuietedDown::
    .string "The generator has gone quiet.\p"
    .string "Only the hum of the tunnel lights\n"
    .string "is left.$"
